abstract: Open protocols, metadata schemas, reproducible analysis workflows, and synthetic
  demonstration resources supporting avian health, conservation breeding, disease surveillance,
  and high-level avian bornavirus research questions at Sunshine BirdWorld, a managed avicultural
  breeding and research centre in rural West Bengal, India. Demonstration datasets in this
  repository are synthetic and must not be represented as institutional results.
